  "readme": "E389 (route association of the champion tokens), code package of 2026-11-20 (the report is the separate html file).\n\ncode/ = the sources that made the numbers, repository-relative paths: training/grid/jroute.py (RouteHead, route_loss), training/train/jroute_train.py (arms m / z), training/data/lane_route_data.py (route GT, route tokens, map modes, fork frames), evaluation/jroute_eval.py (dump / score / rules, paired scene bootstrap), their tests, evaluation/jthresh.py (E388), and code/../reporter (the documentation system that built the report; it imports nothing from the project). No weights, no caches (derived data and checkpoints stay in the repository run folders, see chapter 9 of the report); they need the repository: copy code/ over bev_fusion_lane_center/ and run from there.\nutilities/ = the helper scripts the report names.\nStatus: see the report; TEST untouched."
